#: ../../api/coll.rst:12
msgid "ROCSHMEM_BARRIER_ALL"
msgstr "ROCSHMEM_BARRIER_ALL"

#: ../../api/coll.rst:20
msgid ""
"**Description:** This routine performs a collective barrier across all "
"PEs in the system. The caller is blocked until the barrier is resolved "
"and all updates local and remote are completed. These APIs should be "
"called from only one thread/wavefront/workgroup within the grid to avoid "
"undefined behavior."
msgstr ""
"** 描述：** 该例程在系统中的所有处理元素（PE）上执行一个集合屏障操作。调用方"
"将被阻塞，直到屏障解析完成且所有本地和远程更新均已完成。为避免出现未定义行为"
"，这些 API 应仅由网格内的单个线程/波前/工作组调用。"

#: ../../api/coll.rst:26
msgid "ROCSHMEM_BARRIER_ALL_ON_STREAM"
msgstr "ROCSHMEM_BARRIER_ALL_ON_STREAM"

#: ../../api/coll.rst:30 ../../api/coll.rst:115 ../../api/coll.rst:179
#: ../../api/pt2pt_sync.rst:107 ../../api/rma.rst:79 ../../api/rma.rst:168
#: ../../api/sigops.rst:86
msgid "HIP stream on which to enqueue the operation."
msgstr "用于将该操作加入队列的 HIP 流。"

#: ../../api/coll.rst:33
msgid ""
"**Description:** This routine enqueues a collective barrier operation on "
"a HIP stream. The barrier is performed across all PEs in the system. The "
"operation is enqueued on the specified stream and will execute "
"asynchronously. The caller must synchronize the stream (e.g., using "
"``hipStreamSynchronize``) to ensure completion."
msgstr ""
"** 说明：** 该例程将一个集体屏障操作加入 HIP 流的队列。该屏障操作将在系统中的"
"所有处理元素（PE）上执行。该操作被加入指定的流中，并将异步执行。调用方必须对"
"该流进行同步（例如，使用 ``hipStreamSynchronize ``），以确保操作完成。"

#: ../../api/coll.rst:40
msgid "ROCSHMEM_BARRIER"
msgstr "ROCSHMEM_BARRIER"

#: ../../api/coll.rst:49
msgid ""
"**Description:** This routine performs a collective barrier between all "
"PEs in the system. The caller is blocked until the barrier is resolved."
msgstr ""
"** 说明：** 该例程在系统中的所有处理单元（PE）之间执行一次集体屏障操作。调用"
"方将被阻塞，直到屏障操作完成为止。"

#: ../../api/coll.rst:54
msgid "ROCSHMEM_TEAM_SYNC"
msgstr "ROCSHMEM_TEAM_SYNC"

