#: ../../api/coll.rst:118
msgid ""
"**Description:** This routine enqueues an alltoall collective operation "
"on a HIP stream. The function exchanges a fixed amount of contiguous data"
" blocks between all pairs of PEs participating in the collective routine."
" The operation is enqueued on the specified stream and will execute "
"asynchronously. The caller must synchronize the stream (e.g., using "
"``hipStreamSynchronize``) to ensure completion."
msgstr ""
"** 描述：** 该例程将一个全对全（all-to-all）集体操作加入 HIP 流的队列。该函数"
"在参与集体操作的所有处理元素（PE）两两之间交换固定数量的连续数据块。 该操作被"
"加入到指定的流中，并将异步执行。调用方必须对流进行同步（例如，使用 "
"``hipStreamSynchronize ``），以确保操作完成。"

#: ../../api/coll.rst:125 ../../api/coll.rst:188
msgid ""
"This function creates a separate context for each workgroup to avoid "
"contention on the default context, allowing parallel execution across "
"multiple streams."
msgstr ""
"该函数为每个工作组创建一个独立的上下文，以避免对默认上下文的争用，从而支持跨"
"多个流的并行执行。"

