msgstr "每个参与的处理单元（PE）在源缓冲区中的偏移量数组"

#: ../../api/coll.rst:143
msgid ""
"**Description:** PE i sends source_nelems[j] of data from source + "
"source_displs[j] to PE j. At the same time, PE i receives dest_nelems[j] "
"of data from PE j to be placed at dest + dest_displs[j]. This function "
"must be called as a work-group collective. Valid TYPENAME and TYPE values"
" are listed in :ref:`RMA_TYPES`."
msgstr ""
"** 说明：**PE i 将源地址 source 加上 source_displs[j] 处的数据 "
"source_nelems[j] 发送给 PE j。同时，PE i 接收来自 PE j 的 dest_nelems[j] 数据"
"，并将该数据放置在 dest 加上 dest_displs[j] 处。 此函数必须作为工作组集体操作"
"调用。有效的 TYPENAME 和 TYPE 值列于 :ref:`RMA_TYPES` 中。"

