"**Description:** This routine enqueues a broadcast collective operation "
"on a HIP stream. The function broadcasts data from the root PE to all "
"other PEs participating in the collective routine. The operation is "
"enqueued on the specified stream and will execute asynchronously. The "
"caller must synchronize the stream (e.g., using ``hipStreamSynchronize``)"
" to ensure completion."
msgstr ""
"** 说明：** 该例程将一个广播集体操作加入 HIP 流的队列。该函数将数据从根 PE 广"
