#: ../../api/ctx.rst:17
msgid "Team handle to derive the context from."
msgstr "用于推导上下文的团队标识符。"

#: ../../api/ctx.rst:18
msgid ""
"Options for context creation. Ignored in current design; use the value "
"``0``."
msgstr "上下文创建选项。在当前设计中被忽略；请使用值``0 ``。"

#: ../../api/ctx.rst:19
msgid "A handle to the newly created context."
msgstr "新创建的上下文的句柄。"

#: ../../api/ctx.rst:21
msgid ""
"All threads returns ``0`` if the context was created successfully. If any"
" thread returns non-zero value, the operation fails, ctx is set to "
"``ROCSHMEM_CTX_INVALID`` and a higher number of "
"``ROCSHMEM_MAX_NUM_CONTEXTS`` is required."
msgstr ""
"如果上下文创建成功，所有线程都会返回`0 `。如果任何线程返回非零值，则操作失败"
"，ctx将被设置为`ROCSHMEM_CTX_INVALID `，此时需要更大"
"的`ROCSHMEM_MAX_NUM_CONTEXTS `。"

#: ../../api/ctx.rst:25
msgid ""
"**Description:** This routine creates an rocSHMEM context. By design, the"
" context is private to the calling work-group. It must be called "
"collectively by all threads in the work-group. If the context was created"
" successfully, a value of zero is returned and the context handle pointed"
" to by ctx specifies a valid context; otherwise, a nonzero value is "
"returned and ctx is set to ``ROCSHMEM_CTX_INVALID``. An unsuccessful "
"context creation call is not treated as an error and the rocSHMEM library"
" remains in a correct state. The creation call can be reattempted after "
"additional resources become available."
msgstr ""
"** 说明：**该例程用于创建一个 rocSHMEM 上下文。按设计，该上下文仅供调用该例程"
"的工作组私有使用。工作组中的所有线程必须集体调用该例程。 如果上下文创建成功，"
"则返回零，且由 ctx 指向的上下文句柄指定一个有效的上下文；否则，返回非零值，并"
"将 ctx 设置为 ``ROCSHMEM_CTX_INVALID ``。上下文创建调用失败不会被视为错误，"
"rocSHMEM 库仍保持在正确状态。 当有更多资源可用时，可以重新尝试该创建调用。"

#: ../../api/ctx.rst:34
msgid "ROCSHMEM_CTX_DESTROY"
msgstr "ROCSHMEM_CTX_DESTROY"

#: ../../api/ctx.rst:38
msgid "Context handle."
msgstr "上下文句柄。"

#: ../../api/ctx.rst:42
msgid ""
"**Description:** This routine destroys an rocSHMEM context. It must be "
"called collectively by all threads in the work-group. If ctx has the "
"value ``ROCSHMEM_CTX_INVALID``, no operation is performed."
msgstr ""
"** 说明：** 此例程用于销毁一个 rocSHMEM 上下文。工作组中的所有线程必须集体调"
"用此例程。如果 ctx 的值为 ``ROCSHMEM_CTX_INVALID ``，则不执行任何操作。"

