"``sig_addr`` satisfies the comparison condition ``(*sig_addr cmp "
"cmp_value)``. The wait operation is executed asynchronously on the "
"specified stream. The caller must synchronize the stream (e.g., using "
"``hipStreamSynchronize``) to ensure the wait condition has been "
"satisfied."
